What are Plastic Closure Machines?
Plastic Closure Machines are specialized automated systems designed for manufacturing plastic bottle caps and closures through processes like injection molding, assembly, trimming, and inspection. These precision machines ensure high-volume production while maintaining consistent quality, leak-proof functionality, and compliance with industry regulations—critical factors for packaging pharmaceuticals, beverages, and consumer goods.
The technology portfolio ranges from standalone injection molding machines to integrated systems handling cap forming, threading application, tamper-evident band attachment, and vision-based quality control—all synchronized for optimal throughput and minimal downtime.
